{"4101100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Realm Wreckers", "steam_appid": 4101100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/68c706230914c820f484ecace2b3fb80.poster.avif?t=1770761865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/68c706230914c820f484ecace2b3fb80.webm?t=1770761865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/68c706230914c820f484ecace2b3fb80.mp4?t=1770761865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong></strong></u><br><u><strong>MAN YOUR STATION</strong></u><br><strong>Realm Wreckers</strong> is  a <strong>co-op survival roguelike game</strong> where you must cooperate with your team to fight your way through hordes of enemies. Every player takes on a critical role: man heavy turrets to tear through waves of enemies, pilot drones to scout and support from above, or take the driver’s seat and keep the crew alive through positioning and movement. <br><br><strong>Survival</strong> requires teamwork, how long can your team last?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/59149fd71bdd8b954ebe578f1d1f1bd8.poster.avif?t=1770761865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/59149fd71bdd8b954ebe578f1d1f1bd8.webm?t=1770761865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/59149fd71bdd8b954ebe578f1d1f1bd8.mp4?t=1770761865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong></strong></u><br><u><strong>GROW STRONGER OR GET WRECKED</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy destroyed pushes your run forward. Earn <strong>XP</strong>, level up your crew, and choose from <strong>powerful roguelike upgrades</strong> that permanently change how your tank fights and survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost turret damage, unlock new abilities, enhance mobility, or stack risky perks that turn your tank into a rolling weapon — or a ticking time bomb. Smart upgrade choices and strong team synergy are the difference between breaking through the next wave or being overrun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/a8cb5ac2679abe770d90196b4db4b275.poster.avif?t=1770761865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/a8cb5ac2679abe770d90196b4db4b275.webm?t=1770761865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/a8cb5ac2679abe770d90196b4db4b275.mp4?t=1770761865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/e65bf8c056a21fc90e50c1c86dbd2acd.poster.avif?t=1770761865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/e65bf8c056a21fc90e50c1c86dbd2acd.webm?t=1770761865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101100/extras/e65bf8c056a21fc90e50c1c86dbd2acd.mp4?t=1770761865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragrap